---
// Standard ATS-friendly CV (Italian) — Strict 1-Page A4 Linear Single-Column
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Federico Colombo - Curriculum Vitae (ATS)" description="CV ottimizzato per ATS di Federico Colombo - Technical Artist & Real-Time Graphics Programmer" />
		<style>
			@page {
				size: A4 portrait;
				margin: 0;
			}
			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				font-variant-ligatures: none !important;
				font-feature-settings: 'liga' 0, 'clig' 0, 'calt' 0 !important;
				letter-spacing: normal !important;
				text-align: left;
			}
			body {
				font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
				background-color: #f1f5f9;
				color: #1f2937;
				line-height: 1.32;
				-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
				print-color-adjust: exact;
			}
			.controls {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 14px 20px;
				background-color: #0f172a;
				color: #ffffff;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 12px;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}
			.controls a {
				background-color: #1e293b;
				color: #e2e8f0;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
				padding: 8px 16px;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
				text-decoration: none;
				border-radius: 6px;
				font-weight: 600;
			}
			.controls a.primary {
				background-color: #1d4ed8;
				border-color: #1d4ed8;
				color: #ffffff;
			}
			.document {
				width: 210mm;
				height: 297mm;
				max-height: 297mm;
				margin: 24px auto;
				background-color: #ffffff;
				padding: 10mm 14mm 8mm 14mm;
				box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
				overflow: hidden;
			}
			.cv-header {
				border-bottom: 1.5px solid #0f172a;
				padding-bottom: 5px;
				margin-bottom: 6px;
			}
			h1.cv-name {
				font-size: 17.5pt;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #0f172a;
				line-height: 1.1;
				margin-bottom: 2px;
			}
			.cv-role {
				font-size: 9pt;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #1e3a8a;
				margin-bottom: 3px;
			}
			.cv-meta-line {
				font-size: 7.5pt;
				color: #334155;
				line-height: 1.35;
			}
			.cv-meta-line a {
				color: #1e40af;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 600;
			}
			h2.cv-section-title {
				font-size: 8.6pt;
				font-weight: 800;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: #0f172a;
				border-bottom: 1px solid #94a3b8;
				padding-bottom: 1.5px;
				margin-top: 6.5px;
				margin-bottom: 3.5px;
			}
			.summary-text {
				font-size: 7.65pt;
				line-height: 1.32;
				color: #1f2937;
			}
			.skills-row {
				font-size: 7.55pt;
				line-height: 1.30;
				margin-bottom: 2px;
				color: #1f2937;
			}
			.skills-row strong {
				color: #0f172a;
			}
			.entry-item {
				margin-bottom: 5px;
			}
			.entry-item:last-child {
				margin-bottom: 0;
			}
			.entry-header {
				font-size: 8pt;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #0f172a;
				line-height: 1.24;
				margin-bottom: 1.5px;
			}
			.entry-meta {
				font-size: 7.45pt;
				font-weight: 500;
				color: #475569;
			}
			.entry-link {
				font-size: 7.45pt;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #1e40af;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.entry-bullets {
				list-style: disc;
				padding-left: 14px;
			}
			.entry-bullets li {
				font-size: 7.55pt;
				line-height: 1.29;
				margin-bottom: 1.4px;
				color: #1f2937;
			}
			@media print {
				body {
					background-color: #ffffff;
					margin: 0;
				}
				.controls {
					display: none !important;
				}
				.document {
					margin: 0;
					box-shadow: none;
					width: 210mm;
					height: 297mm;
					max-height: 297mm;
					padding: 10mm 14mm 8mm 14mm;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="controls">
			<a href={`${baseUrl}/Federico Colombo - Curriculum Vitae (Standard).pdf`} download="Federico_Colombo_CV_ATS.pdf" class="primary">Scarica PDF ATS (1 Pagina)</a>
			<a href={`${baseUrl}/cv-ats`}>English Version (ATS)</a>
			<a href={`${baseUrl}/cv-it`}>CV Visuale Web</a>
			<a href={baseUrl}>Torna al Portfolio</a>
		</div>

		<div class="document">
			<header class="cv-header">
				<h1 class="cv-name">FEDERICO COLOMBO</h1>
				<div class="cv-role">Technical Artist &bull; Real-Time Graphics Programmer &bull; Pipeline &amp; XR Engineer</div>
				<div class="cv-meta-line">
					Torino, Italia (Disponibile a trasferimento UE e remoto CET) &bull; Cittadino Italiano / UE &bull; +39 351 307 8191 &bull; <a href="mailto:colombofederico28@gmail.com">colombofederico28@gmail.com</a><br />
					Portfolio: <a href="https://federicocolombo12.github.io/PortFolio/">federicocolombo12.github.io/PortFolio</a> &bull; GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/federicocolombo12">github.com/federicocolombo12</a> &bull; LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/federico-colombo10">linkedin.com/in/federico-colombo10</a>
				</div>
			</header>

			<section>
				<h2 class="cv-section-title">PROFILO PROFESSIONALE</h2>
				<p class="summary-text">
					Technical Artist e Real-Time Graphics Programmer laureando magistrale in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione al Politecnico di Torino (Prevista: Dicembre 2026, 110/110 e Lode; Triennale 100/110). Unisce sviluppo di renderer C++17/OpenGL 3.3 e pipeline compute WebGPU/WGSL con Unity 6 (URP/SRP), Unreal Engine 5, automazione DCC in Python e ottimizzazione XR su visori standalone. Ridotto il tempo frame GPU del 61.3% (da 7.52ms a 2.91ms) a 90 FPS stabili con 0B di allocazioni GC in PulseEngine su Meta Quest 3, costruito un lab compute WebGPU 2D GI da 15 dispatch/frame e formato oltre 60 studenti come Assistente alla Didattica.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="cv-section-title">COMPETENZE TECNICHE</h2>
				<div class="skills-row"><strong>Linguaggi e Shader:</strong> C++17, C#, Python 3, HLSL, GLSL, WGSL, TypeScript/JavaScript, Shader Graph, Unreal Material Editor</div>
				<div class="skills-row"><strong>Motori e API Grafiche:</strong> Unity 6 (URP, SRP Batcher, Compute Shaders, OpenXR, UPM, EditorWindow), Unreal Engine 5 (PCG, Niagara, MetaHumans, Alembic Groom, Live Link, Sequencer, C++/Blueprints), OpenGL 3.3, WebGPU</div>
				<div class="skills-row"><strong>Rendering e Profiling:</strong> Deferred Shading (G-Buffer), Cook-Torrance PBR, Raymarching &amp; SDF, Jump Flooding (JFA), Mikkelsen Surface Gradients, Silhouette POM, 3D Gaussian Splats, RenderDoc, NVIDIA Nsight Graphics, Unity Profiler</div>
				<div class="skills-row"><strong>DCC, Pipeline e Colore:</strong> Blender (scripting bpy), Autodesk Maya, RealityCapture, DaVinci Resolve (ACES/OCIO), OpenUSD, Git / Git LFS, CMake, CI/CD</div>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="cv-section-title">ESPERIENZA PROFESSIONALE</h2>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Technical Artist &amp; Producer (R&amp;D Tesi Magistrale XR — PulseEngine) <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Lemons in the Room &amp; Politecnico di Torino &bull; Firenze / Remoto &bull; 03/2026 – Presente</span></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Progettato un framework di raymarching volumetrico bio-adattivo in Unity 6 URP e compute shader HLSL per Meta Quest 3, mantenendo 90 FPS stabili su hardware standalone.</li>
						<li>Ridotto il frame time GPU del 61.3% (da 7.52ms a 2.91ms) con 0B di allocazioni GC per frame tramite Dynamic Bounding Volumes, ray stepping adattivo e voxelizzazione GPU in compute shader.</li>
						<li>Sviluppato shader HLSL con Surface Gradients di Morten Mikkelsen su volumi SDF per eliminare cuciture UV triplanari, tool Editor di telemetria (DAWMixerWindow) e packaging modulare UPM.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Technical Artist, Gameplay Programmer &amp; Project Lead <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Level Up Lab (Team Studentesco PoliTo) &bull; Torino, Italia &bull; 11/2024 – 07/2026</span></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Impostato pipeline artistiche 2D/3D per <em>Spicy Mercante</em> e <em>Line Operator</em>, definendo sprite atlasing, sorting layer, budget poligonali, naming convention e flussi Git LFS per un team di 6–7 sviluppatori.</li>
						<li>Scritto shader HLSL custom (acqua procedurale con vertex displacement, cutaway dinamici), utility C# di validazione asset e pipeline Blender 3D, profilando draw call e batching per ogni milestone.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Software Developer &amp; Consulente AI <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Intellecto IP &bull; Torino / Remoto &bull; 06/2026 – Presente</span></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Sviluppata una dashboard React per aggregazione di 4+ feed bancari e automatizzati oltre 15 flussi operativi settimanali tramite pipeline LLM Anthropic Claude e integrazioni Notion API.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Assistente alla Didattica — Interfacce Grafiche e Sistemi Multimediali <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Politecnico di Torino &bull; Torino, Italia &bull; 10/2024 – 01/2025</span></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Affiancato oltre 60 studenti di ingegneria nei laboratori settimanali su architettura UI, ottimizzazione frontend e debugging strutturato, redigendo guide tecniche ed esercitazioni pratiche.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Video Artist &amp; Tecnico Operatore Camera <span class="entry-meta">&bull; RKH SRL &bull; Torino, Italia &bull; 09/2023 – 06/2024</span></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Gestito riprese con cineprese digitali (RED, Blackmagic), griglie luci da studio, tracking plate e pipeline di color grading su DaVinci Resolve (ACES/Rec.709).</li>
					</ul>
				</article>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="cv-section-title">PROGETTI CHIAVE</h2>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Graphics Lab Engine (C++17, OpenGL 3.3, GLSL, CMake, RenderDoc) <span class="entry-meta">&bull;</span> <a class="entry-link" href="https://github.com/federicocolombo12">GitHub</a></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Sviluppato da zero un renderer 3D deferred shading in C++17 con G-Buffer, modello PBR Cook-Torrance, Silhouette Parallax Occlusion Mapping (SPOM) in tangent space e profiling su RenderDoc.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">WebGPU 2D Global Illumination Compute Lab (TypeScript, WGSL, 512x512 Float16) <span class="entry-meta">&bull;</span> <a class="entry-link" href="https://github.com/federicocolombo12/webgpu-2d-gi-jfa">Repo</a> <span class="entry-meta">&bull;</span> <a class="entry-link" href="https://federicocolombo12.github.io/webgpu-2d-gi-jfa/">Live</a></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Scritti a mano 8 shader WGSL su una pipeline compute da 15 dispatch/frame: Jump Flooding SDF, Monte Carlo sphere tracing a 16 raggi con GI indiretta 1-bounce, EMA temporale, Bloom in shared memory e AgX Pass Inspector.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Smart Cable Generator &amp; Stylized 3D Gaussian Splats (Python bpy, OpenUSD, EEVEE-Next) <span class="entry-meta">&bull;</span> <a class="entry-link" href="https://github.com/federicocolombo12/Blender-Smart-Cables-Generator">Cables Repo</a></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Creato add-on Python per Blender per cavi catenari parametrici con export FBX/UV automatico e pipeline NPR su 3DGS tramite OpenUSD PointClouds e filtro Kuwahara in Geometry Nodes.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">UE5 Technical Art Studies (PCG, Niagara, MetaHumans, Alembic Groom, Live Link) <span class="entry-meta">&bull;</span> <a class="entry-link" href="https://federicocolombo12.github.io/PortFolio/">Portfolio</a></div>
					<ul class="entry-bullets">
						<li>Realizzati ambienti procedurali con spline PCG e auto-materiali per pendenza/altitudine, sistemi particellari Niagara con curl noise e setup MetaHuman con fisica Alembic groom e mocap Live Link Face.</li>
					</ul>
				</article>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="cv-section-title">FORMAZIONE</h2>
				<div class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione (LM-32) <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Politecnico di Torino &bull; Ott 2024 – Dic 2026 (Prevista, 110/110 e Lode)</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="entry-item">
					<div class="entry-header">Laurea Triennale in Ingegneria del Cinema e dei Mezzi di Comunicazione (L-8) <span class="entry-meta">&bull; Politecnico di Torino &bull; Ott 2021 – Lug 2024 (Voto Finale: 100/110)</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="skills-row" style="margin-top: 2px;"><strong>Lingue:</strong> Italiano (Madrelingua), Inglese (Fluente / C1), Francese (Base), Tedesco (Base)</div>
			</section>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
